  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c1d9175b-b980-40ea-85c2-00600c1169f9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"870\" height=\"490\"></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b0387f65-7be1-4dd4-80e9-51dc17c12f41.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"12\" height=\"26\"> <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">这个资源包</span><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">改变了所有常规和试炼刷怪笼，替换了它们的模型和纹理，同时也修改了宝库的纹理和模型</span></strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5cea18b1-8d44-42e5-baf2-4049291c314a.png\"></strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2f35b879-9c99-4d94-8ad7-241fed54cf77.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"19\" height=\"29\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f31800\">他在</span><span style=\"color:#fff\">干什么！</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li style=\"color:#f31800\"><span style=\"color:#f31800\">更改刷怪笼的纹理和模型</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#f31800\"><span style=\"color:#f31800\">更改试炼刷怪笼的纹理和模型</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#f31800\"><span style=\"color:#f31800\">修改宝库的纹理和模型</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#f31800\"><span style=\"color:#f31800\">刷怪笼纹理包含发光像素</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#f31800\"><span style=\"color:#f31800\">更改钥匙的纹理</span></li>\n</ul><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_58bb23cf-2c2c-4349-a6ab-110533037e6a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"28\" height=\"27\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">重要</span><span style=\"color:#fff\">提示</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>需要安装OptiFine才能正常运行</strong></span></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_be1988cb-5dd7-4e19-83fb-2c28e10dacfa.png\"></strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_32fd4ba4-3c38-4f6a-8f7e-401cee07c813.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"578\" height=\"76\"></strong></p>",
